<title>JAPAN: Japan PMC, Osaka Steel to list on TSE 2nd section.</title>
<headline>Japan PMC, Osaka Steel to list on TSE 2nd section.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo Stock Exchange (TSE) said on Monday that Japan PMC Corp and Osaka Steel Co Ltd would soon list on the second section of the bourse.</p>
<p>Chemicals maker Japan PMC Corp is due to list on December 17 and Osaka Steel, which is currently listed on the Osaka bourse, on November 26.</p>
